  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police have taken formal disciplinary action against Inspector General Ahrie Sonta, resulting in his dismissal from the force. This decision follows a Code of Ethics Commission hearing concerning allegations of illegal surveillance targeting the nation's leadership, including President Prabowo Subianto, as well as several business figures. The National Police Chief has characterized the incident as a betrayal of institutional trust and pledged a thorough investigation into the matter. Concurrently, the Witness and Victim Protection Agency is reviewing reports of intimidation involving six witnesses connected to the case. Political figures and public organizations have expressed support for a transparent investigation, with some groups calling for enhanced national cybersecurity measures. The internal investigation continues as the police navigate the implications of unauthorized surveillance involving high-ranking officials and state infrastructure.",
